  "termsBrandTitle": "Welcome to Nexo",
  "termsBrandBody": "Privacy first. Here we tell you what stays on your device and what leaves it.",
  "termsItemWhatTitle": "What is Nexo",
  "termsItemWhatBody": "An independent, unofficial app created by and for students that reorganizes your UPLA academic information more clearly. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by UPLA.",
  "termsItemPrivacyTitle": "Your data and privacy",
  "termsItemPrivacyBody": "The app only talks to the Nexo API (api.nexo.aurx.pro), hosted on Microsoft Azure with MongoDB Atlas as its database. The API signs in to SIGMA, the Intranet and the Language Center on your behalf: your password is used once and never stored on the server. University sessions are stored encrypted and deleted when you sign out. There is no advertising or analytics.",
  "termsItemSecurityTitle": "Security",
  "termsItemSecurityBody": "Everything travels encrypted (TLS). On the server, university sessions are encrypted with AES-256-GCM, requests are rate limited and sensitive actions are kept in an audit log. On the device, credentials are kept in the system's secure storage (in the browser, only in memory). Signing out deletes the server sessions, the credentials and the cache.",
  "termsItemResponsibleTitle": "Responsible use",
  "termsItemResponsibleBody": "Access only your own information, with your own credentials. Using someone else's credentials may be a crime (Law No. 30096). If you are a teacher, your students' data is confidential and may only be used for academic purposes (Law No. 29733).",
  "termsItemDisclaimerTitle": "No guarantees",
  "termsItemDisclaimerBody": "Nexo is provided \"as is\", without warranties. We are not responsible for misuse of the app or the credentials, nor for decisions made based on the information shown. For official procedures, always check UPLA's systems.",
  "aboutFeatureAllInOneTitle": "Your university in one place",
  "aboutFeatureAllInOneBody": "Profile, schedule, grades, payments, and upcoming tasks without jumping between SIGMA, Intranet, and other portals.",
  "aboutFeatureMultiplatformTitle": "Multiplatform",
  "aboutFeatureMultiplatformBody": "Same experience on Android, iOS, Web, and desktop, with a single Flutter codebase.",
  "aboutFeaturePrivacyTitle": "Privacy first",
  "aboutFeaturePrivacyBody": "Your credentials are stored only on your device. Requests go directly to UPLA services, without intermediate servers.",
  "aboutFeatureNoSdkTitle": "No third-party SDKs",
  "aboutFeatureNoSdkBody": "Authentication and networking built by hand on standard HTTP, to control errors and keep it lightweight.",
  "aboutFooterDisclaimer": "Nexo is an independent, unofficial project, created by and for students. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by UPLA.",
